"title": "Frustrated with constantly broken wireless earbuds",
"body": "Y'all, I don't claim to be a tech whiz or anything, but even this old mechanic here can tell you that these wireless earbuds are driving me up the wall! I mean, I just bought a new pair last week and already one of them is acting funky. It's like they were designed to break after a few uses! I've spent more on these things than on my own car stereo system! Is anyone else having this problem or am I just unlucky? Does anyone have any recommendations for a pair that actually lasts? Tired of constantly replacing them."
}

